<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65796" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλαθρον</span></b> , τό, 
			Ep.
		 gen. sg. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελαθρόφιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					8.279
				</span></i>
			:—<i>roof-tree, ridgepole</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελαθρόφιν ἐξεκέχυντο</span> l.c., cf. <i><span class="en">
				11.278
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ven.</u>
				173
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).161
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				105
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				199
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				113
			</span></i> (ibid., pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ προὔχοντι μελάθρῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					19.544
				</span></i>
			: generally, <i>beam</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>3 Ki.</u>
				7.9(20)
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μ. τῶν θυρίδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PRyl.</u>
					233.5
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>roof</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.414
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				18.150
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>house</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυπαρίσσινον μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					5.40
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐράνιον μ.</span>, of heaven,
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				1101
			</span></i> (lyr.): mostly in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				19.2
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἐν βασιλείοις</span> in
			the king's <i>halls</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				343
			</span></i> (anap.), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς δόμων μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					957
				</span></i>
			; of a cave used as a dwelling, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				147
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				491
			</span></i> (both anap.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lair</i> of an animal, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				2.307
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>cage</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.107
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				423
			</span></i>. (Acc. to <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				576.16
			</span></i> from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελαίνω</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καπνοδόκη</span>; it is doubtful whether
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κμέλεθρον</span> is cogn.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
